      "id": "2113143887594475733",
      "text": "Stop being parasocial freaks and hating on someone on behalf of a streamer. \n\nYes, people were late to our wedding. Yes, it set the wedding back. No, it does not need to be farmed to oblivion by the plague that is drama clippers. \n\nThis job is weird cause you share your personal life online and then as you become more ingrained in it other content creators become your personal life. Then you continue to share your personal life online. But now personal life gets twisted into hate farms by bad faith clippers. (Which quite literally did not exist 2 years ago) \n\nAll of that to say if you are shitting on someone YOU DONT KNOW because they were late to a wedding of someone YOU DONT KNOW. You should go outside. 🙂‍↕️",
